Affected portions and modifications:

* src/ml_models/models_sandbox.py: U-Net helpers (DoubleConv, Down, Up,
  OutConv), PositionalEncoding, PositionalUNet, TransformerModel, CausalConv1d,
  WaveNetBlock, SimpleWaveNet, Seq2SeqEncoder, Seq2SeqDecoder, RNNSeq2Seq and
  the accompanying AE baseline adaptation. SIDERIUS changed configuration,
  dimensions, dtype handling, construction and implementation details. These
  are adaptations, not byte-identical copies of the reviewed upstream version.
* src/ml_models/loss_models_sandbox.py: FocalLoss1D and its FocalLoss1DCW
  extension. SIDERIUS changed constructor/configuration handling and added
  class weighting.
* src/execute_tools/scoring_utils.py: get_one_sec_psd, find_peak, get_snr,
  process_segment and legacy normalized score arithmetic derived from the
  upstream benchmark/denoising score implementation. SIDERIUS changed typed
  configuration, FFT precision, noise-floor/nonfinite handling, rounding,
  scope aggregation and parallel execution.

These acknowledgments identify adapted portions; they do not characterize
the complete modules or the generic framework as upstream copies.

